    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's a ridiculous idea to try and defeat me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So frustrating."
            ]
        }
    },
    "3": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's easy to see all the land around here."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oho? It's Suika."
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you doing here?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was just watching the surface here."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why are you acting like I should have some business with you?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm in charge of this area.",
                "I won't let you run around doing things all willy-nilly without greeting me."
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But I'm just observing things."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And that's it?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Most of the area has already been overrun by nameless spirits."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You get what I'm aiming at, right?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The tanuki here will take care of it."
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This land that has lost its ownership."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nameless spirits possess it and return it to its original state,"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "While Zanmu is stalling big time."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In the end, it's a natural phenomenon. It'll go back to normal over time."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then this incident happened.",
                "What have the humans been doing?"
            ]
        },
        "140_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Isn't that Suika?",
                "What are you up to?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'd like to ask you that myself."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What have <i$you> been up to?",
                "Show it to me!"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What do you mean by showing it to you...?",
                "Hey, what are you doing?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, were you investigating the jewel that yamainu had?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yep. It's a dangerous one.",
                "It's got connections with an oni in Hell."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, right. You're one of those oni, too."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Do you know who Zanmu is?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm surprised.",
                "I thought you were angry."
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Marisa was splendidly dancing on Zanmu's palm."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The natural result, huh?"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, Suika?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's unusual for you to come to the shrine on the mountain."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What the hell were you doing",
                "while this incident was going on?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Show it to me!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Show you what...?",
                "Eek! Wh-What are you doing?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You were a negotiator for the Kiketsu Family?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Exactly, I was seriously reflecting on how to",
                "prevent the warring between the Beast Spirits."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And before I knew it, ",
                "the perilous mood had disappeared..."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I think we can avoid the war altogether."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because we at the Moriya Shrine and Miss ",
                "Biten were working behind the scenes."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Son Biten... Haha, I get it now."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, that was scary."
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Sanae is on top of Zanmu's palm too, huh?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who can I depend on here?",
                "Is Reimu the only one left?"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I hope the advice I gave her at the start",
                "helped her."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Suika?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Speaking of that, when you gave me that advice,",
                "I went to Hell, but..."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There was just a weird oni."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And what did you do after that?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Show it to me!"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Show you what...?",
                "Augh, what are you doing?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You did nothing?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In the midst of all this fuss,",
                "you haven't made a move?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because it was already <b$resolved>."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I had assumed that Chimata had forcibly ",
                "freed the land from all ownership."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But actually, the land was naturally let go",
                "as a result of the market god appearing."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In other words, this incident is a natural phenomenon... ",
                "The only solution is to leave it alone."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Is it natural? ",
                "|\tOr perhaps it's the \"\t,\tfly through the sky\t,Reimu's",
                "Or perhaps it's the \"fly through the sky\" ability?"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is Reimu the only one ",
                "who isn't in Zanmu's palm?"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "From this point forwards, I have one last job for you."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The incident has not been resolved yet!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why did you just do that!?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now all that's left to do is make the final preparations."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, Lady Suika."
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Welcome back to Hell."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You know, the other day, ",
                "you were giving me a hard time."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Was that the time I sent you Lady Zanmu's minions?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What else could I be talking about?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I thought that Lady Suika would be happy to receive them..."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Of course I was!"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But that's besides the point!",
                "I'll punish you!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, I get it."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You want Zanmu to pay attention to you, right?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Weeh."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No matter what I try, ",
                "Zanmu won't even turn to look at me."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I took her minions to another place",
                "and she didn't even say anything about it."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If that's the case, I've got a good job for you."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All right, ",
                "it's time for the big show."
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No matter what I try, ",
                "Zanmu won't even turn to look at me."
            ]
        }
